# Per-machine Claude Code overrides. `.claude/settings.json` and `.claude/hooks/`
# are shared and committed; this one holds local permissions and is not.
# (`*.local` above does not cover it — that pattern matches names *ending* in
# `.local`, and this one ends in `.json`.)
.claude/settings.local.json

